Proposal:
Get k=15 kmers from read file as u32.
Hash, mask down to u30 then reject any above u26 maximum (scale by 16).
Create a 2^26 element u16 counts array (128 MB).
Do saturating increment with u26 hashes as indices to get sketch.
Each read has a single thread, sketch multiple reads in parallel.
